<doc id="137422" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=137422" title="Sacha Distel">
Sacha Distel

Alexandre Sacha Distel (#ALIH) ya iku juru main gitar lan penyanyi saka &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; kang misuwur lumantar lagu-lagu hits cover version kang éntuk pangaji &lt;a href="Academy%20Award%20for%20Best%20Original%20Song"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raindrops%20Keep%20Falling%20on%20My%20Head"&gt;Raindrops Keep Falling on My Head&lt;/a&gt; (lagu asliné kang nyanyi &lt;a href="B.%20J.%20Thomas"&gt;B. J. Thomas&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Scoubidou%20%28song%29"&gt;Scoubidou&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="The%20Good%20Life%20%281962%20song%29"&gt;The Good Life&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké naté nampa Chevalier (Knight) ing adicara &lt;a href="L%C3%A9gion%20d%27honneur"&gt;Légion d'honneur&lt;/a&gt; taun 1997. Kajaba saka kuwi, dhèwèké uga didhapuk minangka pranata adicara ing pangaji &lt;a href="Miss%20Perancis"&gt;Miss Perancis&lt;/a&gt; 1989
<h2>Latar wuri</h2>
Latar wuri.
Sacha Distel, lair kanthi jeneng asli Alexandre Distel, puteri saka kulawarga &lt;a href="White%20%C3%A9migr%C3%A9"&gt;imigran kulit putih&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Russia"&gt;Russia&lt;/a&gt;, Leonid Distel lan pianis keturunan &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt;, André Ventura. Pamané, &lt;a href="Ray%20Ventura"&gt;Ray Ventura&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku salah sawijiné promotor musik &lt;a href="jazz"&gt;jazz&lt;/a&gt;. Ing &lt;a href="dasawarsa"&gt;dasawarsa&lt;/a&gt; 1930-an, Ventura ora lèrèn anggoné promosi minangka ngembangaké musik &lt;a href="swing"&gt;swing&lt;/a&gt; ing Perancis. Nalika pamané manggon ing &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt; lan terjun ing musik orkestra Les Collégiens, Distel didhapuk minangka juru main piano lan gitar.
Taun 1948, Ventura ngundang Distel saperlu dikon nonton pagelaran &lt;a href="Dizzy%20Gillespie"&gt;Dizzy Gillespie&lt;/a&gt; ing musik orkestrané, bareng karo &lt;a href="Bruno%20Coquatrix"&gt;Bruno Coquatrix&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paul%20Misraki"&gt;Paul Misraki&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Andr%C3%A9%20Hornez"&gt;André Hornez&lt;/a&gt;. Lumakuné Distel ing donyané musik nglantaraké ngadohi saka musik orkestra, kang sabanjuré ngedegaké Guy Wormser's &lt;a href="New%20Orleans"&gt;New Orleans&lt;/a&gt;, die-hards, &lt;a href="cool%20jazz"&gt;cool jazz&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="bebop"&gt;bebop&lt;/a&gt; kang dibawahi Distel. Awit saka pambiyantuné Jean Marie Ingrand (bass), &lt;a href="Mimi%20Perrin"&gt;Mimi Perrin&lt;/a&gt; (piano) lan &lt;a href="Jean-Louis%20Viale"&gt;Jean-Louis Viale&lt;/a&gt; (drum), band kang didegaké kuwi kasil ngéntukaké pangaji Coliseum's Night of Jazz "Meilleur Petit Orchestre Moderne". Distel dadi gitaris jazz profésional. Sadawané lumakuné ing musik, dhèwèké makarya bareng &lt;a href="Dizzy%20Gillespie"&gt;Dizzy Gillespie&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tony%20Bennett"&gt;Tony Bennett&lt;/a&gt; sarta nyengkuyung album &lt;a href="The%20Ed%20Sullivan%20Show"&gt;The Ed Sullivan Show&lt;/a&gt;, ing pungkasan dasawarsa 1950-an.
<h2>Pribadi</h2>
Pribadi.
Distel sesambungan asamara karo paraga wanita, &lt;a href="Brigitte%20Bardot"&gt;Brigitte Bardot&lt;/a&gt; taun 1958, kang ngundang ing ulang tauné ing St Tropez. Pacangan iku bubar ing taun 1959. Kejaba iku, dhèwèké uga dadi pacangané penyanyi &lt;a href="Dionne%20Warwick"&gt;Dionne Warwick&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké bebrayan karo atlet ski &lt;a href="olimpiadhe"&gt;olimpiadhe&lt;/a&gt;, Francine Bréaud ing taun 1963.
Sacha Distel séda tanggal 22 Juli 2004, umur 71 taun sawisé kataman lelara rada suwé ing &lt;a href="Rayol-Canadel-sur-Mer"&gt;Rayol-Canadel&lt;/a&gt;, Perancis. Sawenèh minggu sadurungé séda, dhèwèké ésih katon ing adicara televisi &lt;a href="Qui%20veut%20gagner%20des%20millions%20%3F"&gt;Qui veut gagner des millions ?&lt;/a&gt;
