<doc id="137746" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=137746" title="Paule Marshall">
Paule Marshall

Paule Marshall (#ALIH) inggih punika satunggalipun &lt;a href="penulis"&gt;panyerat&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; panganggit &lt;a href="nov%C3%A8l"&gt;novèl&lt;/a&gt; ingkang tansah nyuwantenaken bilih warga kulit cemeng ing Amérikah Sarékat punika bandhanipun kabudayan saking &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Latar wingking</h2>
Latar wingking.
Marshall lair ing Valenza Pauline Burke &lt;a href="Brooklyn"&gt;Brooklyn&lt;/a&gt;, putri saking kulawargi saking &lt;a href="Barbados"&gt;Barbadian&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ngumbara wonten ing &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; taun 1919. Piyambakipun sinau wonten &lt;a href="Girls%20High%20School"&gt;Girls High School&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brooklyn%20College"&gt;Brooklyn College&lt;/a&gt; (1953) lan &lt;a href="Hunter%20College"&gt;Hunter College&lt;/a&gt;, New York (1955). Ing taun 1950 piyambakipun sesémahan kaliyan &lt;a href="psikolog"&gt;psikolog&lt;/a&gt; Kenneth Marshall; lajeng pepisahan ing taun 1963. &lt;a href="Dasawarsa"&gt;Dasawarsa&lt;/a&gt; 1970-an, piyambakipun sesémahan malih kaliyan Nourry Menard, asal &lt;a href="Haiti"&gt;Haiti&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka &lt;a href="sastrawan"&gt;sastrawan&lt;/a&gt; saking kalangan kulit cemeng, piyambakipun tansah nyuwantenaken bilih warga kulit cemeng ingkang wonten Amérikah Sarékat punika bandhanipun kabudayan saking &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;.
Wonten ing wiwitan kiprahipun ing jagat kasusastran, piyambakipun nyerat &lt;a href="geguritan"&gt;geguritan&lt;/a&gt;, nanging salajengipun malih wonten &lt;a href="prosa"&gt;prosa&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Nov%C3%A8l"&gt;Novèl&lt;/a&gt; wiwitanipun, &lt;a href="Brown%20Girl%2C%20Brownstones"&gt;Brown Girl, Brownstones&lt;/a&gt; kababar taun 1959. Paule Marshall pikantuk bebungah saking &lt;a href="Guggenheim%20Fellowship"&gt;Guggenheim Fellowship&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1960, lan salajengipun nganggit Soul Clap Hands and Sing, kempalan sekawan novèl ingkang kasil nampèni bebungah National Institute of Arts Award. Tahun 1965, dia dipilih oleh &lt;a href="Langston%20Hughes"&gt;Langston Hughes&lt;/a&gt; untuk bergabung dengannya dalam tour donya Departemen Nagara, di mana mereka berdua membacakan karya-karya mereka, yang menjadi cikal-bakal awal kariernya. Mboten dangu sasampunipun, piyambakipun nyerat novèl &lt;a href="The%20Chosen%20Place%2C%20the%20Timeless%20People"&gt;The Chosen Place, the Timeless People&lt;/a&gt; (1969), ingkang kasebat déning New York Times Book Review minangka "satunggal saking sekawan novèl impresif ingkang naté dipunserat déning panyerat Amérika kulit cemeng", lan &lt;a href="Praisesong%20for%20the%20Widow"&gt;Praisesong for the Widow&lt;/a&gt; (1983), ingang nglantaraken piyambakipun nampèni bebungah &lt;a href="Before%20Columbus%20Foundation"&gt;Before Columbus Foundation&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="American%20Book%20Award"&gt;American Book Award&lt;/a&gt; taun 1984.
Marshall mucal wonten ing &lt;a href="Virginia%20Commonwealth%20University"&gt;Universitas Persemakmuran Virginia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="University%20of%20California%2C%20Berkeley"&gt;Universitas California, Berkeley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iowa%20Writers%27%20Workshop"&gt;Workshop Kepenulisan Iowa&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Yale%20University"&gt;Universitas Yale&lt;/a&gt; sadèrèngipun kapracaya minangka Ketua Helen Gould Sheppard Chair of Literature and Culture ing &lt;a href="New%20York%20University"&gt;Universitas New York&lt;/a&gt;. Taun 1993 piyambakipun nampi gelar &lt;a href="Honorary%20degree"&gt;kinormatan L.H.D.&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Bates%20College"&gt;Bates College&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun manggèn wonten &lt;a href="Richmond%2C%20Virginia"&gt;Richmond, Virginia&lt;/a&gt;. Taun 2010, Paule Marshall nampi bebungah Lifetime Achievement Award saking Anisfield-Wolf Book Awards.
