Musik pangiring kanggé filem Oscar and Lucinda punika dipunbabar déning &lt;a href="CBS%20Masterworks%20Records"&gt;CBS Masterworks Records&lt;/a&gt; surya 9 Dhésèmber 1997 ing Australia lan Amérikah Sarékat. Wondéne juru rekam dipunayahi déning &lt;a href="Thomas%20Newman"&gt;Thomas Newman&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bruckner%20Orchestra%20Linz"&gt;Bruckner Orchestra&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Paramount%20Pictures"&gt;Paramount Scoring Stage&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="The%20Village%20Recorder"&gt;The Village Recorder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles%2C%20California"&gt;Los Angeles, California&lt;/a&gt; surya 9 dumugi 30 Juni 1997.
