The Amazing Grace inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sujarah"&gt;sujarah&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Nigeria"&gt;Nigeria&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun 2006. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Jeta%20Amata"&gt;Jeta Amata&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénario anggitanipun &lt;a href="Jeta%20Amata"&gt;Jeta Amata&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Nick%20Moran"&gt;Nick Moran&lt;/a&gt;. Wondéné juru damel dipunayahi déning Amata lan Alicia Arce. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Joke%20Silva"&gt;Joke Silva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nick%20Moran"&gt;Nick Moran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scott%20Cleverdon"&gt;Scott Cleverdon&lt;/a&gt;, Mbong Odungide, Fred Amata, lan Zack Amata. &lt;a href="Joke%20Silva"&gt;Joke Silva&lt;/a&gt; kadhapuk dados narator ing filem punika. The Amazing Grace kasil mlebet ing sewelas nominasi lan menangi bebungah &lt;a href="Africa%20Movie%20Academy%20Award%20for%20Best%20Cinematography"&gt;Achievement in Cinematography&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Africa%20Movie%20Academy%20Awards"&gt;Africa Movie Academy Awards&lt;/a&gt; taun 2007.
