Little Fish (filem)

Little Fish punika &lt;a href="Film"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun 2005. Filem punika dipunsutradarani déning &lt;a href="Rowan%20Woods"&gt;Rowan Woods&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénario anggitanipun Jacquelin Perske. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Cate%20Blanchett"&gt;Cate Blanchett&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sam%20Neill"&gt;Sam Neill&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Hugo%20Weaving"&gt;Hugo Weaving&lt;/a&gt;. Pamundhutan gambar filem punika kacakaken wonten saindhengipun Kutha Sydney, &lt;a href="Cabramatta"&gt;Cabramatta&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Fairfield%2C%20New%20South%20Wales"&gt;Fairfield&lt;/a&gt;. Wondéné juru damel filem punika dipunayahi déning Vincent Sheehan lan Liz Watts saking Porchlight Films sesarengan kaliyan &lt;a href="Cate%20Blanchett"&gt;Cate Blanchett&lt;/a&gt; lan Dirty Films kagunganipun &lt;a href="Andrew%20Upton"&gt;Andrew Upton&lt;/a&gt;. Little Fish dipunbabar sesarengan kanggé sagung pamirsa ing Australia surya 8 Sèptèmber 2005 lan panèn pangalembana saking para pamirsa, sarta juru kritik.
