<h2>Latar wingking</h2>
Latar wingking.
Little Fish panèn pangalembana saking sagung pamirsa ugi juru kritik filem. Roten Tomatos maringi katrangan bilih 89% pamirsa remen dhumateng filem punika, jumbuh kaliyan pratélanipun 27 juru kritik. &lt;a href="Metacritic"&gt;Metacritic&lt;/a&gt; nglaporaken, filem punika nampi biji ngancik angka 77 saking 100, dhedhasar pratélanipun 9 juru kritik, mratandhani bilih filem punika estu dipunremeni. Para juru kritik kathahipun sami remen kaliyan skénario lan kaprigelanipun para juru paraga kados ngendikanipun Owen Gleiberman saking &lt;a href="kalawarta"&gt;kalawarta&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Entertainment%20Weekly"&gt;Entertainment Weekly&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Bebungah</h2>
Bebungah.
Filem punika mlebet tiga welas nominasi wonten &lt;a href="Australian%20Film%20Institute%20Awards"&gt;Australian Film Institute Awards&lt;/a&gt; taun 2005, lan nampi bebungah wonten gangsal pahargyan, inggih punika &lt;a href="Australian%20Film%20Institute%20Award%20for%20Best%20Actor%20in%20a%20Leading%20Role"&gt;Juru Paraga Priya Paling Sae&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Hugo%20Weaving"&gt;Hugo Weaving&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Australian%20Film%20Institute%20Award%20for%20Best%20Actress%20in%20a%20Leading%20Role"&gt;Juru Paraga Wanita Paling Sae&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Cate%20Blanchett"&gt;Cate Blanchett&lt;/a&gt;), Juru Paraga Wanita Panyengkuyung Paling Sae (&lt;a href="Noni%20Hazlehurst"&gt;Noni Hazlehurst&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Australian%20Film%20Institute%20Award%20for%20Best%20Achievement%20in%20Editing"&gt;Juru Besut Filem Paling Sae&lt;/a&gt;. Kajawi punika, ugi nampi bebungah ing &lt;a href="Inside%20Film%20Awards"&gt;Inside Film Awards&lt;/a&gt;, inggih punika Juru Paraga Wanita Paling Sae (Cate Blanchett) lan Juru Paraga Priya Paling Sae (Hugo Weaving).
