<doc id="138109" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=138109" title="Baywatch (filem)">
Baywatch (filem)

Baywatch inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="komedi"&gt;kumedhi&lt;/a&gt; laga saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun &lt;a href="2017"&gt;2017&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Seth%20Gordon"&gt;Seth Gordon&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénario anggitanippun &lt;a href="Damian%20Shannon"&gt;Damian Shannon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mark%20Swift"&gt;Mark Swift&lt;/a&gt;, dipunangkat saking &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="televisi"&gt;televisi&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah ingkang sami. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Dwayne%20Johnson"&gt;Dwayne Johnson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zac%20Efron"&gt;Zac Efron&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alexandra%20Daddario"&gt;Alexandra Daddario&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kelly%20Rohrbach"&gt;Kelly Rohrbach&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Priyanka%20Chopra"&gt;Priyanka Chopra&lt;/a&gt;, Jon Bass, &lt;a href="Ilfenesh%20Hadera"&gt;Ilfenesh Hadera&lt;/a&gt;, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, &lt;a href="David%20Hasselhoff"&gt;David Hasselhoff&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Pamela%20Anderson"&gt;Pamela Anderson&lt;/a&gt;. Pandamelan filem punika kawiwitan surya 22 Fèbruari 2016 ing &lt;a href="Miami"&gt;Miami&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Florida"&gt;Florida&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Savannah%2C%20Georgia"&gt;Savannah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Georgia%20%28U.S.%20state%29"&gt;Georgia&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Paramount%20Pictures"&gt;Paramount Pictures&lt;/a&gt; netepaken pambabaran filem ing surya 26 Méi 2017. Baywatch punika filem kaping kalih pakaryanipun Johnson lan Daddario, sasampunipun sami-sami makarya wonten filem &lt;a href="San%20Andreas%20%28film%29"&gt;San Andreas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;.
