<h2>Latar wingking</h2>
Latar wingking.
Ing wulan Sèptèmber 2012 wonten pawarta bilih pangripta &lt;a href="Reno%20911%21"&gt;Reno 911!&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Aktor"&gt;juru paraga&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Robert%20Ben%20Garant"&gt;Robert Ben Garant&lt;/a&gt; badhé ngarahaken filem Baywatch kanggé Paramount Pictures. Surya 2 Oktober 2014, &lt;a href="Dwayne%20Johnson"&gt;Dwayne Johnson&lt;/a&gt; mlebet wonten pratélan juru paraga ingkang badhé ngayahi jejibahan minangka paraga baku, Justin Malen kadhapuk nyerat malih skénarionipun. Ing surya 23 Juli 2015, &lt;a href="Seth%20Gordon"&gt;Seth Gordon&lt;/a&gt; katetepaken minangka sutradara, lan Johnson sumadya dados juru damel Dany Garcia lumantar Seven Bucks Productions, sesarengan kaliyan &lt;a href="The%20Montecito%20Picture%20Company"&gt;The Montecito Picture Company&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Beau%20Flynn"&gt;Beau Flynn&lt;/a&gt;. Damian Shannon lan Mark Swift nyerat orèk-orèkan pungkasan kanggé nglebetaken suwasana kumedhi ing filem wau. 10 Agustus 2015, Zac Efron napak asmani kontrak saperlu ndhèrèk nyengkuyung filem, lan juru damel badhé kajibah déning &lt;a href="Beau%20Flynn"&gt;Beau Flynn&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ivan%20Reitman"&gt;Ivan Reitman&lt;/a&gt; sesarengan Seven Bucks Productions kagunganipun Johnson. Surya 9 November 2015, &lt;a href="Deadline.com"&gt;Deadline&lt;/a&gt; nglaporaken bilih pitu juru paraga wanita ingkang kacathet badhé maragani, nglampahi pandadaran antawisipun &lt;a href="Alexandra%20Daddario"&gt;Alexandra Daddario&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ashley%20Benson"&gt;Ashley Benson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nina%20Dobrev"&gt;Nina Dobrev&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alexandra%20Shipp"&gt;Alexandra Shipp&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shelley%20Hennig"&gt;Shelley Hennig&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bianca%20A.%20Santos"&gt;Bianca A. Santos&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Denyse%20Tontz"&gt;Denyse Tontz&lt;/a&gt;. Surya 18 November 2015, Johnson mratélakaken bilih Daddario sumadya maragani kanggé mangsa katiga, minangka panjagi pasisir ingkang nresnani Efron.
Ing surya 4 Januari 2016, &lt;a href="Kelly%20Rohrbach"&gt;Kelly Rohrbach&lt;/a&gt; badhé maragani minangka C. J. Parker ingkang dipunpratélakaken lumantar &lt;a href="Instagram"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; kagunganipun Johnson. Damian Shannon lan Mark Swift nganggit skénario, sawatawis Johnson sumadya dados juru damel sesarengan Dany Garcia lumantar Seven Bucks Productions, Flynn, Reitman, &lt;a href="Michael%20Berk"&gt;Michael Berk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Douglas%20Schwartz"&gt;Douglas Schwartz&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Gregory%20J.%20Bonann"&gt;Gregory J. Bonann&lt;/a&gt;. Ing surya 27 Januari 2016, Jon Bass katetepaken ndhèrèk maragani ing filem punika minangka Ronnie, tiyang ingkang lucu, prigel beksan ing pasisir ingkang nandang tresna dhumateng Parker. 12 Fèbruari 2016, &lt;a href="Hannibal%20Buress"&gt;Hannibal Buress&lt;/a&gt; nyawiji ing proyèk filem punika kanthi maragani minangka anggota bay community lokal. 17 Fèbruari 2016, &lt;a href="Priyanka%20Chopra"&gt;Priyanka Chopra&lt;/a&gt; ugi sumadya maragani wonten filem Baywatch, minangka paraga &lt;a href="antagonis"&gt;antagonis&lt;/a&gt;. Ing wulan Maret 2016, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II katetepaken maragani minangka Ellerbee, pulisi ingkang sumanak. 12 Maret 2016, &lt;a href="Belinda%20Peregr%C3%ADn"&gt;Belinda&lt;/a&gt; ngendika bilih sagah ndhèrèk nyengkuyung filem punika. Semanten ugi tumrap Jack Kesy lan &lt;a href="Amin%20Joseph"&gt;Amin Joseph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vine%20%28service%29"&gt;Vine&lt;/a&gt;, Logan Paul, lan &lt;a href="Izabel%20Goulart"&gt;Izabel Goulart&lt;/a&gt;. Pandamelan filem kawiwitan ing surya 22 Fèbruari 2016, ing &lt;a href="Deerfield%20Beach%2C%20Florida"&gt;Deerfield Beach, Florida&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi latar wingking &lt;a href="Broward%20County%2C%20Florida"&gt;Broward County&lt;/a&gt;, Florida, sawatawis manawi ing TV mundhut latar wingking &lt;a href="Malibu%2C%20California"&gt;Malibu, California&lt;/a&gt;. Pamundhutan gambar katindakaken ing Pasisir &lt;a href="Miami"&gt;Miami&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Savannah%2C%20Georgia"&gt;Savannah, Georgia&lt;/a&gt;. Pungkasaning Maret 2016, gambar kapundhut ing &lt;a href="Tybee%20Island%2C%20Georgia"&gt;Tybee Island&lt;/a&gt;, Georgia.
<h2>Pambabaran</h2>
Pambabaran.
Ing wulan Januari 2016, &lt;a href="Paramount%20Pictures"&gt;Paramount Pictures&lt;/a&gt; netepaken pambabaran filem Baywatch surya 19 Mèi 2017, ingkang sadèrèngipun katetepaken minangka wanci pambabaran &lt;a href="sequel"&gt;sequel&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Terminator%20Genisys"&gt;Terminator Genisys&lt;/a&gt;. Ing wulan Désèmber 2016, Paramount ngulur satunggal peken pambabaran ing surya 26 Mèi 2017, nggantos wancinipun pambabaran filem.
