American Made (filem)

American Made (sadèrèngipun sesirah Mena) inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="biografi"&gt;biografi&lt;/a&gt; kriminal thriller saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun &lt;a href="2017"&gt;2017&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Doug%20Liman"&gt;Doug Liman&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénario anggitanipun Gary Spinelli, dipunangkat saking lelampah pagesangan &lt;a href="Barry%20Seal"&gt;Barry Seal&lt;/a&gt;, tilas pilot &lt;a href="TWA"&gt;TWA&lt;/a&gt; ingkang nylundhupaken &lt;a href="narkoba"&gt;narkoba&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="dasawarsa"&gt;dasawarsa&lt;/a&gt; 1980-an lajeng dipunwangsulaken déning &lt;a href="DEA"&gt;DEA&lt;/a&gt; saperlu dipundadosaken intelijen. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Tom%20Cruise"&gt;Tom Cruise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Domhall%20Gleeson"&gt;Domhall Gleeson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jesse%20Plemons"&gt;Jesse Plemons&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sarah%20Wright"&gt;Sarah Wright&lt;/a&gt;. Filem ingkang kalebet pakaryan kapisan tumrapipun sutradara Liman lumantar &lt;a href="Universal%20Pictures"&gt;Universal Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, punika katetepaken badhé dipunbabar ing surya 29 Sèptèmber 2017 sasampunipun nyutradarani filem &lt;a href="The%20Bourne%20Identity%20%28film%29"&gt;The Bourne Identity&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Lelampahan</h2>
Lelampahan.
American Made myariyosaken babagan &lt;a href="Barry%20Seal"&gt;Barry Seal&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Tom%20Cruise"&gt;Tom Cruise&lt;/a&gt;), satunggalipun &lt;a href="TWA"&gt;TWA&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipun-bon déning &lt;a href="CIA"&gt;CIA&lt;/a&gt; saperlu mbiyantu ngadhepi paham &lt;a href="kuminis"&gt;kuminis&lt;/a&gt; énggal ing Amérika Tengah. Punapa ingkang sampun dipuntumindakaken déning Seal wonten operasi pandhelikan CIA punika ndadosaken piyambakipun mlebet wonten kaanan ruwet kaliyan kartel Medellin, ingkang pungkasanipun adamel lingsem Présidhèn &lt;a href="Ronald%20Reagan"&gt;Ronald Reagan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Gedhung%20Putih"&gt;Gedhung Pethak&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun &lt;a href="Iran-Contra"&gt;skandal Iran-Contra&lt;/a&gt; dipirsani déning para warga.
