<doc id="138530" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=138530" title="The Equalizer (filem)">
The Equalizer (filem)

The Equalizer inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; thriller laga saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun &lt;a href="2014"&gt;2014&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Antoine%20Fuqua"&gt;Antoine Fuqua&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénario anggitanipun Richard Wenk, dipunangkat saking &lt;a href="Sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara seri&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="televisi"&gt;televisi&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah ingkang sami. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Denzel%20Washington"&gt;Denzel Washington&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Marton%20Csokas"&gt;Marton Csokas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chlo%C3%AB%20Grace%20Moretz"&gt;Chloë Grace Moretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="David%20Harbour"&gt;David Harbour&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bill%20Pullman"&gt;Bill Pullman&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Melissa%20Leo"&gt;Melissa Leo&lt;/a&gt;.
Pandamelan filem punika kawiwitan ing wulan Juni 2013 ing sapérang panggènan ing &lt;a href="Massachusetts"&gt;Massachusetts&lt;/a&gt;. The Equalizer punika filem kapisan sayuk karyanipun &lt;a href="Village%20Roadshow%20Pictures"&gt;Village Roadshow Pictures&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan &lt;a href="Sony%20Pictures%20Entertainment"&gt;Sony Pictures Entertainment&lt;/a&gt; awit &lt;a href="Saving%20Silverman"&gt;Saving Silverman&lt;/a&gt; taun 2001. Filem punika, kaping pisan dipun-giyaraken ing pahargyan &lt;a href="Toronto%20International%20Film%20Festival"&gt;Toronto International Film Festival&lt;/a&gt; surya 7 September 2014, lan dipunbabar kanggé sagung pamirsa sadonya ing surya 26 Sèptèmber 2014.
Sasampunipun kababar, The Equalizer nampi warni-warni pamanggih saking para pamirsa lan juru kritik, ingkang kathahipun sami ngalembana lumantar kaprigelan para juru paraganipun, suwantenipun, lan jagragipun. Kados ingkang kacathet déning &lt;a href="box%20office"&gt;box office&lt;/a&gt;, filem punika kasil ngempalaken arta langkung saking $192 yuta. Filem chandhakipun ugi sampun dipunwartosaken badhé dipundamel, ingkang dipunsengkuyung déning Denzel Washington malih minangka paraga baku.
