Ing wulan Mèi 2012 kawartosaken bilih &lt;a href="Luke%20Wilson"&gt;Luke Wilson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zachary%20Quinto"&gt;Zachary Quinto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Topher%20Grace"&gt;Topher Grace&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Johnny%20Galecki"&gt;Johnny Galecki&lt;/a&gt; wiwitanipun katetepaken badhé maragani filem punika, sesarengan kaliyan &lt;a href="Karyn%20Kusama"&gt;Karyn Kusama&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ngayahi jejibahan minangka sutradara, dhedhasar skénario anggitanipun &lt;a href="Phil%20Hay%20%28screenwriter%29"&gt;Phill Hay&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Matt%20Manfredi"&gt;Matt Manfredi&lt;/a&gt;, wondéné XYZ Films badhé ndamel filem punika sesarengan Martha Griffin, Manfredi dan Hay. nanging ing wulan Juli 2014 dipunpratélakaken bilih pandamelan filem punika wonten éwah-éwahan, inggih punika &lt;a href="Logan%20Marshall-Green"&gt;Logan Marshall-Green&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Michiel%20Huisman"&gt;Michiel Huisman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Emayatzy%20Corinealdi"&gt;Emayatzy Corinealdi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lindsay%20Burdge"&gt;Lindsay Burdge&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="John%20Carroll%20Lynch"&gt;John Carroll Lynch&lt;/a&gt; badhé maragani filem punika, kanthi juru damel &lt;a href="Gamechanger%20Films"&gt;Gamechanger Films&lt;/a&gt;.
Filem punika dipun-giyaraken kaping pisan nalika adicara &lt;a href="South%20by%20Southwest"&gt;South by Southwest&lt;/a&gt; tanggal surya 13 Maret 2015. Boten dangu salajengipun dipunwartosaken bilih &lt;a href="Drafthouse%20Films"&gt;Drafthouse Films&lt;/a&gt; sampun numbas hak pangeduman filem punika. Salajengipun, filem pikantuk pangormatan dipun-giyaraken ing pahargyan &lt;a href="London%20Film%20Festival"&gt;London Film Festival&lt;/a&gt; surya 9 Oktober 2015. The Invitation dipunbabar winatesan ing surya 8 April 2016 ugi dipundum lumantar &lt;a href="video%20on%20demand"&gt;video on demand&lt;/a&gt;.
