<doc id="138555" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=138555" title="Casino Royale (filem 2006)">
Casino Royale (filem 2006)

Casino Royale inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kaping selikur saking &lt;a href="James%20Bond%20%28serial%20film%29"&gt;seri film James Bond&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipundamel déning &lt;a href="EON%20Productions"&gt;EON Productions&lt;/a&gt;, Stillking Films lan Babelsberg Studio. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Martin%20Campbell"&gt;Martin Campbell&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénario anggitanipun Paul Haggis, Neal Purvis lan Robert Wade, dipunangkat saking &lt;a href="nov%C3%A8l"&gt;novèl&lt;/a&gt; asesirah &lt;a href="Casino%20Royale%20%28nov%C3%A8l%29"&gt;Casino Royale&lt;/a&gt; anggitanipun &lt;a href="Ian%20Fleming"&gt;Ian Fleming&lt;/a&gt;. Wondéné juru damel filem punika &lt;a href="Michael%20G.%20Wilson"&gt;Michael G. Wilson&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Barbara%20Broccoli"&gt;Barbara Broccoli&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Daniel%20Craig"&gt;Daniel Craig&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Eva%20Green"&gt;Eva Green&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mads%20Mikkelsen"&gt;Mads Mikkelsen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Judi%20Dench"&gt;Judi Dench&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jeffrey%20Wright"&gt;Jeffrey Wright&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Giancarlo%20Giannini"&gt;Giancarlo Giannini&lt;/a&gt;.
Casino Royale punika filem kaping pisan kagemipun &lt;a href="Daniel%20Craig"&gt;Daniel Craig&lt;/a&gt; minangka agèn 007 &lt;a href="James%20Bond"&gt;James Bond&lt;/a&gt;, nggantosi &lt;a href="Pierce%20Brosnan"&gt;Pierce Brosnan&lt;/a&gt;. Ugi filem kaping gangsal saking &lt;a href="Judi%20Dench"&gt;Judi Dench&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="M%20%28James%20Bond%29"&gt;M&lt;/a&gt; lan kapisan sayuk karya kaliyan Daniel Craig. Casino Royale dipungiyaraken kaping pisan ing &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt; surya 14 Novèmber 2006 lan dipunbabar ing &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; surya 17 Novèmber 2006. Sasampunipun kababar, filem punika pikantuk pangalembana saking sagung pamirsa lan juru kritik.
<h2>Lelampahan</h2>
Lelampahan.
Ing filem punika kacariyosaken bilih James Bond (&lt;a href="Daniel%20Craig"&gt;Daniel Craig&lt;/a&gt;) ngayahi jejibahan minangka telik sandhi, ngindhik-indhik satunggalipun téroris saking Madagaskar, Mollaka (Sebastien Foucan). Amargi mboten jumbuh kaliyan ingkang dipunkajengaken, lajeng Bond ngayahi jejibahan punika piyambakan, madosi lan ngempalaken katrangan ngengingi teroris saking M-16.
Kanthi nyepeng katrangan punika, lajeng Bond tumuju wonten Nassau, Bahamas saperlu manggihi Alex Dimitrios (Simon Abkarian) lan pacanganipun, Solange (Caterina Murino). Bond ugi mangertos bilih Dimitrios wonten sesambetan kaliyan Le Chiffre (&lt;a href="Mads%20Mikkelsen"&gt;Mads Mikkelsen&lt;/a&gt;), salah satunggalipun juragan bank lan cukong ingkang kathah ngragati kagiyatan para teroris sadonya.
Adhedhasar laporan saking intelijen, Le Chiffre ngrancang lan ngempalaken ardhana lumantar kagiyatan main (judi) kanthi totohan inggil ing Le Casino Royale i Montenegro. Bond, sesarengan Vesper Lynd (&lt;a href="Eva%20Green"&gt;Eva Green&lt;/a&gt;), René Mathis (&lt;a href="Giancarlo%20Giannini"&gt;Giancarlo Giannini&lt;/a&gt;) lan agèn CIA Felix Leiter (&lt;a href="Jeffrey%20Wright"&gt;Jeffrey Wright&lt;/a&gt;), dipundhapuk ngasoraken Le Chiffre ingkang badhé ngobrak-abrik pranatan organisasi punika.
