<doc id="138713" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=138713" title="I Saw the Light (filem)">
I Saw the Light (filem)

I Saw the Light inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="biografi"&gt;biografi&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun 2015. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Marc%20Abraham"&gt;Marc Abraham&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun ugi ngrangkep minangka juru damel lan panganggit skénario. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Tom%20Hiddleston"&gt;Tom Hiddleston&lt;/a&gt; minangka juru &lt;a href="Country%20music"&gt;musik country legendaris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hank%20Williams"&gt;Hank Williams&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Elizabeth%20Olsen"&gt;Elizabeth Olsen&lt;/a&gt; minangka sémahipun ingkang kapisan, &lt;a href="Audrey%20Williams"&gt;Audrey Williams&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika dipunangkat saking buku kanthi sesirah Hank Williams: The Biography anggitanipun Colin Escott, George Merritt, lan William (Bill) MacEwen. I Saw the Light pikantuk pangurmatan dipunbabar kaping pisan wonten adicara Special Presentations pahargyan &lt;a href="2015%20Toronto%20International%20Film%20Festival"&gt;Toronto International Film Festival&lt;/a&gt; taun 2015. Filem punika kagolong ing &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; biografi ingkang nyariyosaken babagan gesangipun pangripta lagu country lan blues, Williams, ingkang misuwur lan dados panceripun para juru musik sanèsipun. Sesirah filem punika kapundhut saking salah satunggalipun lagu ingkang dipunripta lan dipuntingalaken déning Williams. I Saw the Light kababar ing surya 25 Maret 2016, déning &lt;a href="Sony%20Pictures%20Classics"&gt;Sony Pictures Classics&lt;/a&gt;.
