I Love NY, ingkang ugi misuwur kanthi sesirah I Love New Year, inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara romantis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="komedi"&gt;kumedhi&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Radhika%20Rao%20%28director%29"&gt;Radhika Rao&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Vinay%20Sapru"&gt;Vinay Sapru&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="http%3A//www.bloggerpile.com/"&gt;Sunny Deol&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kangana%20Ranaut"&gt;Kangana Ranaut&lt;/a&gt; minangka paraga baku. Filem punika dipundamel déning &lt;a href="Bhushan%20Kumar"&gt;Bhushan Kumar&lt;/a&gt; lan Krishan Kumar lumantar perusahaan &lt;a href="T-Series"&gt;Super Cassettes Industries Ltd&lt;/a&gt;. Pamundhutan gambar filem punika kathahipun ngginakaken papan panggènan wonten ing &lt;a href="Mumbai"&gt;Mumbai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York%20City"&gt;New York City&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bangkok"&gt;Bangkok&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika sajatosipun dipunangkat saking filem sandhiwara &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="The%20Irony%20of%20Fate"&gt;The Irony of Fate&lt;/a&gt; (1976). Sasampunipun nglangkungi sapérang alangan, pungkasanipun filem punika dipunbabar ing surya 10 Juli 2015.
