<h2>Latar wingking</h2>
Latar wingking.
Ing surya 19 Sèptèmber 2013 wonten pawartos bilih &lt;a href="Cate%20Blanchett"&gt;Cate Blanchett&lt;/a&gt; badhé kajibah minangka sutradara filem sandhiwara thriller ingkang dipunangkat saking &lt;a href="Belanda"&gt;Walandi&lt;/a&gt; sesrirah &lt;a href="The%20Dinner%20%28book%29"&gt;The Dinner&lt;/a&gt; anggitanipun &lt;a href="Herman%20Koch"&gt;Herman Koch&lt;/a&gt;. Wondéné skénario badhé dipunanggit déning &lt;a href="Oren%20Moverman"&gt;Oren Moverman&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Caldecot%20Chubb"&gt;Caldecot Chubb&lt;/a&gt; kadhapuk minangka juru damel awit panyuwunipun ChubbCo Film, wondéné &lt;a href="Olga%20Segura"&gt;Olga Segura&lt;/a&gt; lan Eva Maria Daniels ugi nyengkuyung minangka juru damel palaksana, lan mbiyantu pangembangan filem wau. Ing pungkasan wulan Januari 2016, dipunpratélakaken bilih &lt;a href="Moverman"&gt;Moverman&lt;/a&gt; ugi sumadya ngayahi minangka sutradara filem punika. Kajawi punika, Chubb, &lt;a href="Lawrence%20Inglee"&gt;Lawrence Inglee&lt;/a&gt;, Eddie Vaisman lan Julia Lebedev ugi sumadya dados prodhuser.
Pandamelan filem punika kawiwitan ing surya 21 Januari 2016, mundhut papan panggènan wonten &lt;a href="Dobbs%20Ferry%2C%20New%20York"&gt;Dobbs Ferry&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York%20%28state%29"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, kalajengaken ing &lt;a href="Gettysburg%2C%20Pennsylvania"&gt;Gettysburg&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Pennsylvania"&gt;Pennsylvania&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing wulan Mèi 2016, &lt;a href="The%20Orchard%20%28company%29"&gt;The Orchard&lt;/a&gt; numbas hak pangeduman filem punika. Panggiyaran filem punika kapisan nalika pahargyan &lt;a href="Berlin%20International%20Film%20Festival"&gt;Berlin International Film Festival&lt;/a&gt;, wulan Fèbruari 2017. Wondéné pambabaranipun dipun-cakaken ing surya 5 Mèi 2017.
