<doc id="138778" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=138778" title="Atractomorpha crenulata">
Atractomorpha crenulata

Atractomorpha crenulata ya iku spésiès &lt;a href="walang"&gt;walang&lt;/a&gt; saka génus &lt;a href="Atractomorpha"&gt;Atractomorpha&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Taksonomi</h2>
Taksonomi.
Walang Atractomorpha crenulata anggota saka génus &lt;a href="Atractomorpha"&gt;Atractomorpha&lt;/a&gt;, saka kulawarga &lt;a href="Pyrgomorphidae"&gt;Pyrgomorphidae&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Johan%20Christian%20Fabricius"&gt;Johan Christian Fabricius&lt;/a&gt;,ing buku Supplementum Entomologiae Systematicae taun 1793, nyathet walang iki kanthi jeneng Truxalis crenulatus, banjur mau A. crenulata crenulata déning &lt;a href="William%20Forsell%20Kirby"&gt;William Forsell Kirby&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun 1910. Kanthi mangkono, A. crenulata dadi jeneng binominalé, kang diwedharaké déning &lt;a href="Henri%20Louis%20Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric%20de%20Saussure"&gt;Henri Louis Frédéric de Saussure&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1862.
Kéwan iki duwèni 3 sub spésiès, ya iku:
<ul>
<li>A. c. crenulata (&lt;a href="Johan%20Christian%20Fabricius"&gt;Fabricius&lt;/a&gt;, 1793)</li>
<ul>
<li>Synonyms: A. c. consobrina, A. c. obscura, A. c. porrecta, A. c. scaber</li>
</ul>
<li>A. c. fumosa (&lt;a href="Ignacio%20Bol%C3%ADvar"&gt;Bolívar&lt;/a&gt;, 1905)</li>
<li>A. c. prasina (&lt;a href="Ignacio%20Bol%C3%ADvar"&gt;Bolívar&lt;/a&gt;, 1905)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Wedharan</h2>
Wedharan.
A. crenulata duwé awak warna ijo, kanthi suwiwi semu abang. Ukurané sedheng miturut racaké walang. Sunguté amung cendhèk.
<h2>Sebaran</h2>
Sebaran.
A. crenulata sumebar ing India, Bangladès, Sumatra, Sri Lanka lan Viètnam kidul. Keith McE. Kevan duwé panemu manawa walang &lt;a href="Atractomorpha%20similis"&gt;Atractomorpha similis&lt;/a&gt; kang tinemu ing pulo-pulo &lt;a href="Sundha%20cilik"&gt;Sundha cilik&lt;/a&gt; sajatiné kalebu A. crenulata.
