<doc id="138785" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=138785" title="Hierodula patellifera">
Hierodula patellifera

Hierodula patellifera, arané &lt;a href="dh%C3%A9y%C3%A9"&gt;dhéyé&lt;/a&gt; kang umum tinemu ing tanah Jawa, kang kalebu &lt;a href="g%C3%A9nus"&gt;genus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hierodula"&gt;Hierodula&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Wedharan</h2>
Wedharan.
&lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9y%C3%A9"&gt;Dhéyé&lt;/a&gt; lanang ukurané watara 45-65mm, déné kang wadon 65–75&amp;nbsp;mm.
Wernané bisa ijo utawa soklat kayu.
<h2>Sebaran</h2>
Sebaran.
&lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9y%C3%A9"&gt;Dhéyé&lt;/a&gt; iki tinemu ing &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hawaii"&gt;Hawaii&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Semenanjung%20Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;Semenanjung Koréa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Papua%20Nugini"&gt;Papua Nugini&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cina"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Taiwan"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sumba"&gt;Sumba&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Honshu"&gt;Honshu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shikoku"&gt;Shikoku&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Okinawa"&gt;Okinawa&lt;/a&gt; ing Jepang, &lt;a href="Taiwan"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Habitat</h2>
Habitat.
H. patellifera urip ing wit-witan lan ing sesuketan, ing sawah utawa pinggir alas.
